+cd backend
+npm install
+npm start
+```
+
+### Email Not Sending
+
+**Check:**
+- `EMAIL_PASSWORD` is correct in Render environment
+- Spacemail account is active and not suspended
+- Render logs show email attempt
+- Email isn't in spam folder
+
+**Fix:**
